Another set of tweaks and fixes in main branch:

- Adjustments for dialog box for moving stacks between groups;
- Increased difficulty of Sickness Challenges (the same type of change that was made for Physical Challenges);
- Fixes for recipe and library re-indexing;
- Readjusted animation card speed. Please ensure your setting is correct in your game settings!
- Removed number from Get Closer skill while in a challenge;
- Fixed a bug where moving a character with Shift+Click did not unlock Create Expedition button;
- Fixed voiceover volume control in Settings;
- Hotfix - fixed a problem with map scrolling, where the lower the scrolling speed, the bigger the scroll inertia.

