Some may have already read, that release day is coming very soon. And indeed it is! The short, but very productive period of Early Access is about to end on 20th November. 

So let me take this opportunity to sincerely thank our fantastic community for all feedback, suggestions and ideas, because you helped to shape this game. 

We do have a couple surprised for the coming months, including free DLCs with new content (not only that, but let us surprise you).

As of yesterday, we've got a Release Candidate 2 build on the main branch (v1.RC2.1113), that contains the following changes:

- A set of new tutorials (and some fixes for the old ones);
- Removed Double Click, context menu is now opened with LMB;
- Revised god bonuses;
- Small difficulty boost to Tactical, Intuition and Physical Challenges (because they are based on stats which every character has);
- Added an option to Settings to allow turning map grid on or off;
- General bug fixes.

Have fun and thank you all!

