How to access beta branch:
Right click on Thea in your Steam Library and select Properties. Then go to the last tab (Betas), enter "KuChwaleGorda" as password and from the drop-down menu select the beta branch.

Please report any bugs found in this thread:
http://steamcommunity.com/app/378720/discussions/0/490125737463308373/

